From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PrismML-Eng <contact@prismml.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] common, tools : DSpark drafter runtime, kv-mean-center tool, speculative

The DSpark Markov drafter (CUDA and Metal), the speculative-decoding
changes that size the draft context by n_embd_out and take the block layout
from the draft model, the kv-mean-center calibration tool, and the
rs-rollback examples.

Note: telecode builds with LLAMA_BUILD_EXAMPLES=OFF, so the examples/ files
are carried but never compiled.

Provenance
----------
Source:   https://github.com/PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp
Branch:   prism
Range:    5ea87ddad22541a37053c7ba92b02ec1923617c6..9a9394a895b96003ca842a6041cb28ac49a108f7
Base tag: b10615 (the fork's base is b10615 plus one unrelated webgpu commit,
          which is NOT included here - this diff is the fork's own work only)
Part 7 of 10, split by file group from the full 14,759-line fork diff.
llama.cpp is MIT licensed; the fork carries the same terms.
---
